  "solution_ref": "$\\mathrm P(p,2p+k)$, $\\mathrm Q(p+1,2p+k+2)$. $\\left(\\frac23\\right)^{p+3}+1=2p+k$, $\\left(\\frac23\\right)^{p+2}+\\frac83=2p+k+2$ → $\\left(\\frac23\\right)^{p+2}=1$, $p=-2$. $k=\\frac23+1+4=\\frac{17}3$",
